mb|P|MB|?|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|It is hard for me to decide how good my hand is and what to bid. I know I want to play in spades because I have a self sufficient suit. A self sufficient suit is a suit that has at most one loser opposite a singleton assuming normal breaks. My 7 spades to the KQJ meet that criteria.|
