nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I have 6 HCP, 3 length points, 2 points for singleton (although it is my partners suit), and 1 quality suit point. I will discount the @HQ because of the bidding. So I will bid 4@S but not be surprised if it goes down.|
