UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A little lucky it made because of the heart lead. The heart lead was reasonable on the auction, but unfortunately for defense, it worked out well for me. Leading away from a KJ is risky, although less so when partner supports the suit. And since West has a nice natural club lead, I might have chosen to lead the @CQ.|
PG| ***** 103 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Anyway, the point is you should learn Bergen Hand Evaluation because it particularly helps when you have distributional hands, as the last 2 deals have demonstrated.|
PG| ***** 104 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Learning Bergen Hand Evaluation is the single best thing you can do to improve your bidding. It is more important than any conventions. My website has the best tutorials on the subject put together by Kia the Movie Maker.|
PG| ***** 105 ***** |


